      "source_xml_line": 117,
      "string_id": "rad_found_deputy_dialog_1_200",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I can't give you anything, I don't have any money. You can keep his stuff if you want.",
      "JA_current": "金が無くて報酬が出せないんだ。もし欲しいならアンタが取って来た奴らの持ち物をやるよ。",
      "JA_new": "何も渡せない。金がないんだ。よければ、そいつの持ち物は持っていっていい。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
